# Upload only the player and the dockerfile. Without this the context is the
# whole repo and Library/ alone is 5 GB.
#
# ⚠ The negations must re-open each PARENT directory before its children.
# gitignore semantics say a file cannot be re-included if a parent directory
# is excluded, so a bare `*` + `!build/worker/**` uploads NOTHING — measured:
# a 54-byte context and a build that failed on a missing /workspace/server.
/*
!/build
/build/*
!/build/worker
!/server
/server/*
!/server/Dockerfile.worker
